<name>All Bible Places</name>
<description>Every place named in the Bible, located where modern scholarship puts it. Pins are coloured by kind; pale pins are uncertain locations. Names show for the most-mentioned places; click any pin for its details. Interactive atlas: https://hj367.github.io/bible-places/ . Places: OpenBible.info Bible Geocoding Data (CC BY 4.0); some outlines © OpenStreetMap contributors.</description>
