<Placemark><name>Gaash</name><styleUrl>#mountain-n</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Identified with:</b> Within 10 km of Timnath-heres</p><p><b>Confidence:</b> Very likely (83% of current scholarship)</p><p><b>Other proposed sites:</b> Khirbet esh Shuna (6%)</p><p><b>Mentioned</b> 4 times, first in Joshua 24:30.</p><p><b>Books:</b> Joshua (1), Judges (1), 2 Samuel (1), 1 Chronicles (1)</p><p><b>Other translations:</b> Mount Gaash, Nahale-gaash</p><p><a href="https://hj367.github.io/bible-places/#gaash">Open Gaash in the All Bible Places atlas</a></p><p><a href="https://www.openbible.info/geo/ancient/ab05a42/gaash">Sources on OpenBible.info</a></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>35.10729,32.00806,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Golgotha</name><styleUrl>#mountain-u-n</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Identified with:</b> Church of the Holy Sepulchre</p><p><b>Confidence:</b> Possible (43% of current scholarship)</p><p><b>Other proposed sites:</b> Taylor Golgotha (3%); Gordon’s Calvary (-2%)</p><p><b>Mentioned</b> 4 times, first in Matthew 27:33.</p><p><b>Books:</b> Matthew (1), Mark (1), Luke (1), John (1)</p><p><b>Other translations:</b> Place of a Skull, Place of the Skull, The Skull, Calvary, The Place of a Skull, The Place of the Skull</p><p><a href="https://hj367.github.io/bible-places/#golgotha">Open Golgotha in the All Bible Places atlas</a></p><p><a href="https://www.openbible.info/geo/ancient/a631d35/golgotha">Sources on OpenBible.info</a></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>35.22975,31.77844,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kir</name><styleUrl>#mountain-u-n</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Identified with:</b> Der</p><p><b>Confidence:</b> Possible (46% of current scholarship)</p><p><b>Other proposed sites:</b> within 100 km of the Kura River (10%); Amuk Valley (7%); another name for Koa (7%); within 50 km of Tell Meskene (6%)</p><p><b>Mentioned</b> 4 times, first in 2 Kings 16:9.</p><p><b>Books:</b> 2 Kings (1), Isaiah (1), Amos (2)</p><p><a href="https://hj367.github.io/bible-places/#kir-1">Open Kir in the All Bible Places atlas</a></p><p><a href="https://www.openbible.info/geo/ancient/ab92800/kir-1">Sources on OpenBible.info</a></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>45.93139,33.12361,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
