<Placemark><name>Mount Shepher</name><styleUrl>#mountain-n</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Identified with:</b> Within 50 km of Haradah</p><p><b>Confidence:</b> Very likely (98% of current scholarship)</p><p><b>Other proposed sites:</b> Jebel Araif en Nakah (-7%)</p><p><b>Mentioned</b> 2 times, first in Numbers 33:23.</p><p><b>Books:</b> Numbers (2)</p><p><b>Other translations:</b> Mount Shapher, Shapher</p><p><a href="https://hj367.github.io/bible-places/#mount-shepher">Open Mount Shepher in the All Bible Places atlas</a></p><p><a href="https://www.openbible.info/geo/ancient/a39fe14/mount-shepher">Sources on OpenBible.info</a></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>34.30356,30.50662,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
